# zod 3.25.76 in mobile-expo/package-lock.json: DoS via unbounded array
# validation. It comes in only through @expo/cli (the Expo tool run on a
# developer's own machine to publish the phone shell); it is not in the web
# app, the desktop app or the phone shell itself, and it never validates
# outside input. The fix exists only in zod 4, and even the newest @expo/cli
# (58.1.15) still requires zod ^3.25.76, so there is nothing to upgrade to yet.
# Look again when @expo/cli moves to zod 4.
CVE-2023-54404 exp:2027-01-31
